WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:03.860
A wandering Hindu renunciant
owns almost nothing:

2
00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:06.820
a robe, a bowl and a staff.

3
00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:10.050
Down the road, a Hindu
householder works hard,

4
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.630
earns a salary and pays the bills.

5
00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:16.950
And a Hindu movement founded
in 1897 runs hospitals,

6
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.430
schools and disaster relief.

7
00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:25.680
So is wanting money a spiritual failure,
or can wealth serve God and the poor?

8
00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:28.970
In this mission, you'll meet
the four aims of human life,

9
00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:31.490
and see where wealth stands among them.

10
00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:36.410
Then you'll see why that movement
calls its work a way of serving God.

11
00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:41.950
Your mission: find out whether wealth can
serve God and the poor in Hindu teaching.
